{'symbol': 'TFC', 'date': '2022-08-24 11:00:00', 'title': 'TRUIST APPOINTS INDUSTRY VETERAN SCOTT STANZEL AS EVP, CHIEF COMMUNICATIONS OFFICER', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C. , AUG. 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRUIST FINANCIAL CORPORATION (NYSE: TFC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT SCOTT STANZEL WILL JOIN THE COMPANY AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF COMMUNICATIONS OFFICER, EFFECTIVE OCT. 1, 2022.'}